# Pull request review

There is **no** requirement to install or run the **CodeRabbit** or **Codex** command-line tools before **`git push`**. Use ordinary GitHub pull-request review and any optional checks configured on the repository.

If you change **versioning** wording in **`.coderabbit.yaml`**, keep **AGENTS.md**, **CLAUDE.md**, **`docs/versioning.md`**, and **`.cursor/rules/versioning.mdc`** aligned.
